<</Producer(iText\256 5.5.5 \2512000-2014 iText Group NV \(AGPL-version\))/Title(MEMORANDUM FOR THE RECORD: [SCHEDULE FOR GENERAL WALTERS MIDCOURSE SPEAKING ENGAGEMENT])/Keywords( Approved For Release 2004/04/19 : CIA-RDP80R01731 R001900100008-7\r\n 17 October 1974\r\n Possible Schedule for General Walters Midcourse Speaking Engagement\r\n 4 November - 1200-1250\r\n 1300-1350\r\n 12 November - 1300-1350\r\n 19 November - 0800-0850\r\n 20 November - 1230-1320\r\n 3 December  - 1300-1350\r\n \(Course Ends 6 December 1974 - Graduation Address - General Graham\)    IL L E GIB\r\n DIA review\(s\) completed.\r\n On file OSD release instructions apply.\r\n Approved For Release 2004/04/19 : CIA-RDP80R01731 R001900100008-7\r\n\f t,  -W0L:   I,:I._~ i_~.     !...i..  .?l:f i?~\\li_,                                                                                          :i   1            i~i_r;       I -7\r\n Lfs~ !c li             L'r_;p<r f,: nt                                                                                                                   I i  c-.  ;:?.>:   r J.       i4\r\n pproved For Release 2004/04/19 : CIA-RDP80R01731 R001900100008-7\r\n R SENIOR N 1, ER IN CU+SSS\r\n 11t1~_._~?',                    ;205\) LTC CG ZI`G\r\n COL BLOTTT_E, USA,  AIELA,  P"'_K1ST_'?1N\r\n CAPT GIBSON, USAF, A_a:':\\, '.I',?'\\'.;ISCIu'I         9 Scp - 1 Nov 1974    Special\r\n COL NUNFMAKER, USAF,               AUSTRALIA\r\n ',~::::'1:^;,\r\n COL ROGERS, USA, DA-it\r\n COL SIE:,:,ERT, USA, A1'.l,       1 E.\r\n LCDR SMITH, USN, .\\1LUS_1A, TAIUAN\r\n g I  \(I;n~ 206\)  AJ W.EBB\r\n LATIN LA'CiF=dC&_QPu _ 209\) LCDR RE!TZEL\r\n LTC KAUFMAN, USA, A 1RMA, PERU\r\n COL RUE, USA, AREA, URUGUAY\r\n COL VILLA, USAF, AIRA, i iEXICO\r\n 210\)\r\n COL KIENZLE, USAF, AIPZA, NETHERLANDS\r\n LCDR RO~,ISON, USN, A_\\LUSN "., SW DEN,\r\n LCDR RYAN, US'i, A1LU:Na, PORTUGAL\r\n COL TASSIE, USA, DATT/AR:%AA, AUSTRIA\r\n CAPT WHEELER, USN, ALUSNA, SWEDEN ,\r\n LT BOSLEY, USN, AALUSNA, KHMER REPUBLIC\r\n MAJ COLLINS, USA, AAnMA, VIETNAM\r\n CAPT CURRIER, USAF, AAIRA, KHMER REPUBLIC\r\n MAJ HILLER, USA, AARMA, KHMER REPUBLIC\r\n MAJ KLIX, USAF, AAIRA, VIETNAM\r\n BG ROUND, USA, DATT/AU`?SA, LAOS\r\n S-TU it _?` 'C* f-1,  00T :.ft\r\n Col _ oc.l Lawrence R.  'ass-i. e , USA,  ;ATT/\r\n 24 Sep - 25 Oct 1974 - Special\r\n 8 Oct - 8 Nov 1974 - Special\r\n FAS"LEf'- E.l .ROH-\( F\r\n 208\) LTCOL STACK.\r\n LTC CASHWELL, USA, AARNA., FINLAND\r\n COL HERMANN, USA, ARNA, FINLAND\r\n COL KOTAS, USA, AIUNLA, BULGARIA\r\n LT SOMMERS, USN, AALUSNA, INDIA\r\n COL VERNON, USA, ARMA, USSR                     30 Sep - 6 Dec 1974 - Special\r\n CAPT WILKE, USAF, AAIRA, EGYPT\r\n LTCOL ZALEWSKI, USAF, AIRA, POLAND              9 Sep-27 Sep - FAES-30 Sep - 18 Oct 1974 -\r\n ?                                               Special\r\n Approved For Release 2004/04/19 : CIA-RDP80R01731 R001900100008-7\r\n\f FIRST ROW:    \(L to R\)        COL SIEBERT, USA; COL KOTAS, USA; COL RAY, USA; COL KIENZLE, USAF;\r\n CAPT WHEELER, USN; COL HERMANN, USA; COL TASSIE, USA; COL NUNEMAKER,\r\n USAF; COL VILLA, USAF; COL BLOTTIE, USA\r\n SECOND ROW:   \(L to R\)        COL RUE, USA; CAPT GIBSON, USAF; LT BOSLEY, USN; MAJ HILLER, USA;\r\n MAJ KLIX, USAF; CAPT CURRIER, USAF; LT COL PESHKIN, USAF; MAJ DEVITT,\r\n USA; COL ROGERS, USA\r\n THIRD ROW:    \(L to R\)        LCDR SMITH, USN; LTC KAUFMAN, USA; LCDR RYAN, USN; LCDR ROBISON, USN;\r\n LT SOI?u ERS, USN; CAPT WILKE, USAF\r\n Approved For Release 2004/04/19 : CIA-RDP80R01731 R001900100008-7\r\n\f Approved For Release 2004/04/19 : CIA-RDP80R01731 R001900100008-7\r\n MEMORANDUM FOR:  General Walters\r\n You have agreed in principle to talk to the\r\n current class of military attaches.  Attached\r\n is a list of dates which are open, a roster\r\n of the members, and their photographs.  They\r\n would like to know which date you can do it.\r\n BG Round is coming to the Agency on Friday\r\n and will make a courtesy call on you at 0945.\r\n He is going to Laos and was at one time an\r\n Asst Army Attache in Paris \(prior to your\r\n tour there\).\r\n Nancy/29 Oct 74\r\n \(DATE\)\r\n MEMORANDUM FOR:  General Walters\r\n Subjects Colonel Boak would like to have you\r\n touch upon when you speak to attaches are:\r\n Experiences of an Attache\r\n Lessons learned\r\n Application today and in the future\r\n Human collection\r\n \(DATE\)\r\n FORM\r\n I  AUGN54   101   WHICHCMAY  BEMUSTo  101\r\n ED.\r\n Approved For Release 2004/04/19 : CIA-RDP80R01731 R001900100008-7\r\n)/Subject(MEMORANDUM FOR THE RECORD: [SCHEDULE FOR GENERAL WALTERS MIDCOURSE SPEAKING ENGAGEMENT])/ModDate(D:20161216003730Z)/CreationDate(D:20161216003730Z)>>
